BITEZZA is a smart food pre-order mobile application designed for college canteens, allowing students and faculty to order meals in advance and avoid long queues during short break times. The app provides a digital platform where users can browse the canteen menu, select food items, place orders, and receive a digital pickup token for quick collection at the counter. It includes features such as real-time menu updates, order tracking, online payment options, order history, and cancellation/refund support, while a separate canteen admin dashboard allows staff to manage menus, monitor incoming orders, update item availability, and track daily sales. By streamlining the ordering process and reducing crowding during peak hours, BITEZZA improves efficiency for canteen operators while offering a faster, more convenient dining experience for students and faculty.', 'Completed', NULL, '2026-03-06 13:15:11.482+00', '2026-03-06 13:15:13.526873+00', '2026-03-06 13:15:13.526873+00');
